{"format":"frame-text","version":1,"id":"32742404-6bba-48e5-ac93-866117a2842f","title":"Recettes de saison","created":"2026-10-20T08:00:00.000Z","modified":"2026-10-20T08:00:00.000Z","settings":{"autoIndent":false,"titleInText":true,"columns":{"count":1,"rule":false},"index":[],"comments":[],"theme":{"v":1,"id":"carnet","name":"Carnet","note":"Nunito, titre manuscrit, rouge tomate et vert tige.","modified":false,"text":{"font":"Nunito","size":11.5,"line":1.6,"space":0.6,"align":"","indent":""},"accent":"#c8402c","styles":{"title":{"font":"Caveat","size":32,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#c8402c","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},"headings":[{"font":"Nunito","size":17,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#c8402c","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":14,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"#2f7d32","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":12,"bold":true,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":12,"bold":false,"italic":true,"underline":false,"caps":false,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""},{"font":"Nunito","size":11,"bold":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"caps":true,"smallcaps":false,"color":"","align":"","rule":false,"number":""}],"bullets":[{"symbol":"•","color":"#c8402c"},{"symbol":"◦","color":""},{"symbol":"▪","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""},{"symbol":"–","color":""}]},"table":{"style":"raye","color":"theme","header":true,"first":false,"total":false,"last":false,"bands":true,"bandcols":false,"sep":false,"font":"","size":0,"pad":""},"callout":{"look":"fond","color":""},"quote":{"look":"fond","color":""},"toc":{"title":"Plan","showTitle":true,"titleStyle":"petites-capitales","titleAlign":"gauche","docTitle":false,"levels":2,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","frame":"cadre","number":"titres","leaders":true,"indent":true,"preset":"compact"},"diagram":{"fill":"#fde2e1","stroke":"#e74c3c","textColor":"#78281f","link":"#c0392b","font":"Segoe UI","strokeWidth":1.5,"shadow":false,"palette":false},"margins":null},"mode":"note","pages":{"size":"A4","w":210,"h":297,"orient":"portrait","turned":{},"margins":{"top":25,"bottom":25,"left":25,"right":25},"numbers":{"on":true,"pos":"bas-centre","format":"1","from":1,"first":1,"font":"","size":10,"color":"","bold":false,"italic":false,"box":"aucun","skip":{}},"header":{"on":true,"html":""},"footer":{"on":true,"html":""},"firstDifferent":false,"keep":true,"tagsAfterCover":true,"custom":false}},"content":{"html":"<h1 class=\"ft-title\">Recettes de saison</h1><span class=\"ft-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"width: 42%\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"><span class=\"ft-caption\" contenteditable=\"true\">La récolte du samedi</span></span><p>Trois recettes de la journée de cuisine d’octobre, avec les variétés du <a class=\"ft-doclink\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-doc=\"3c124e80-6d59-4a63-abc3-d70bc4c6b255\" title=\"Lien vers « Catalogue des tomates » (double-clic : ouvrir ; clic droit : autres choix)\">catalogue</a>.</p><h2>Coulis de tomates</h2><h3>Ingrédients (6 bocaux)</h3><ul><li>3&nbsp;kg de tomates bien mûres (Noire de Crimée ou Cœur de bœuf)</li><li>2 oignons</li><li>3 gousses d’ail</li><li>1 bouquet de basilic</li><li>Huile d’olive, sel, poivre</li></ul><h3>Préparation</h3><ol><li>Faire revenir les oignons émincés dans l’huile d’olive.</li><li>Ajouter les tomates coupées en morceaux et l’ail écrasé.</li><li>Laisser mijoter 45 minutes à feu doux, à couvert.</li><li>Mixer, ajouter le basilic, puis mettre en bocaux bien chauds.</li></ol><blockquote class=\"ft-callout\" data-look=\"fond\" data-color=\"vert\"><p><b>Astuce.</b> Une cuillère de sucre corrige l’acidité des tomates encore un peu vertes.</p></blockquote><h2>Salade tricolore</h2><p>Couper en tranches une Cœur de bœuf, une Noire de Crimée et une Green Zebra. Alterner les couleurs sur un grand plat, ajouter de la mozzarella, du basilic et un filet d’huile d’olive. Servir aussitôt.</p><h2>Tomates cerises rôties</h2><p>Disposer les grappes entières dans un plat, arroser d’huile, saler, ajouter du thym. Enfourner 20 minutes à 200&nbsp;°C. Les servir tièdes, sur une tartine de fromage frais.</p><blockquote class=\"ft-callout ft-quote\"><p>Une tomate cueillie le matin n’a pas le même goût le soir.</p><p class=\"ft-quote-src\">Proverbe du jardin</p></blockquote>"},"tags":[{"name":"Cuisine","color":"rose"},{"name":"Tomates","color":"rouge"}],"links":[],"meta":{}}